{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wendi-e-o047a","title":"曹丕禁止非礼祭祀和巫祝","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-o047a-account","label":"《文帝纪》正文","text":"曹丕禁止非礼祭祀和巫祝","evidence":["wendi-e-o047a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"颁诏","evidence":["wendi-e-o047a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":224,"label":"黄初五年十二月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y224","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o043","basis":"黄初五年十二月"},"evidence":["wendi-e-o047a-q","wendi-q-o043","wendi-q-b-e09b197132729f696314"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-o047a-q","source_order":[2,431,"O047a"],"order":654}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0170","name":"曹丕","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wendi-e-o047a-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-85683c9fc3b42e063808","layer":"original","quote":"十二月，诏曰：“先王制礼，所以昭孝事祖〖18〗：大则郊社〖19〗，其次宗庙，三辰、五行，名山、水川〖20〗。非此族也〖21〗，不在祀典。叔世衰乱〖22〗，崇信巫史；至乃宫殿之内，户牖之间，无不沃酹〖23〗。甚矣其惑也！自今，其敢设非（祀）〔礼〕之祭、巫祝之言，皆以执左道论〖24〗。著于令典〖25〗。”","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":430,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":151},{"id":"wendi-q-b-e09b197132729f696314","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-e09b197132729f696314","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗五年：黄初五年（公元 224）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":433,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-692b4f63358e20733a52","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wendi-q-o043","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-d707a7274b9e3cf20438","layer":"original","quote":"五年春正月〖1〗，初令“谋反大逆乃得相告〖2〗；其余，皆勿听治。敢妄相告，以其罪罪之”。三月，行自许昌还洛阳宫。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":426,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":56}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
